  m_text: "<size=24>Unicorn Cascade Free Spins are triggered with 4 successful Cascades.
    \nOn the 5th Cascade (4 successful winning cascades) the player is awarded \n8
    free spins. Each consecutive cascade will add 2 more free spins. \nFree Spins
    will begin with a win multiplier of 2 and each successful cascade \nwill increase
    the win multiplier by 2 to max of 10. \nFree Spins can be re-triggered with 4
    or more successful cascades."
