    m_TypeName: UnityEngine.UI.MaskableGraphic+CullStateChangedEvent, UnityEngine.UI,
      Version=1.0.0.0, Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=null
  m_text: "<size=24>All wins pay LEFT to RIGHT on adjacent reels, beginning with leftmost
    reel, \nexcept scatters. All wins are paid on lines played, except scatters, which
    are \nadded to line wins. Highest win paid on any played line, except scatters.
    \nTotal Wager is minimum bet (25) multiplied by Coins.\n\nAll wins are multiplied
    by the number of coins bet per line, except Scatters. \nAll symbols in winning
    combinations will be removed and new symbols will \ncascade into the empty spaces.
    Lines are re-evaluated for symbols in winning \ncombinations and values are added
    to the meter. Reels continue to cascade \nuntil no winning symbol combinations
    are created as result of the cascading \nreels. Each successful cascade will increase
    the win multiplier by 1 to a max of 5."
